{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wieslawsoltes/SharpForge/pulls/4564","id":4735123301,"node_id":"PR_kwDOU59Ms88AAAABGjw_ZQ","html_url":"https://github.com/wieslawsoltes/SharpForge/pull/4564","diff_url":"https://github.com/wieslawsoltes/SharpForge/pull/4564.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/wieslawsoltes/SharpForge/pull/4564.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wieslawsoltes/SharpForge/issues/4564","number":4564,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Project 4: retain implementation, qualification and remaining-work evidence","user":{"login":"wieslawsoltes","id":2297442,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyOTc0NDI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2297442?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wieslawsoltes","html_url":"https://github.com/wieslawsoltes","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wieslawsoltes/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wieslawsoltes/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wieslawsoltes/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wieslawsoltes/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wieslawsoltes/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wieslawsoltes/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wieslawsoltes/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wieslawsoltes/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wieslawsoltes/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Why\n\nProject 4 needs a reviewable record of the implementation delivered in this continuation, the exact qualification evidence, and the acceptance work that remains. This PR retains the evidence after eighteen implementation PRs merged; it does not close the remaining project issues or declare a release qualified.\n\n## Changes\n\n- Record all 244 issue / Work-ID pairs observed on the public Project 4 board, the original issue and claim audit, and 43 work groups.\n- Link eighteen merged implementation PRs to their tested local commits, identical published trees, successful PR core runs, merge commits, and successful main core runs.\n- Retain all 175 raw captures (7,205,688 bytes), indexed by SHA-256, including the original findings and their corrected replays. The large diff is complete evidence, rather than expanded source implementation.\n- Reconcile the remaining work: reserved TAP and DAP changes, bounded bytecode exclusions, R015 browser execution and release reconstruction, and broader qualification requirements.\n- Update the IL document preservation note to reference its completed 124-test validation and 32-case campaign.\n\n## Verification\n\n- Final combined implementation: `d64188af91f03d02041316bdde2ee64fd0634be0`, tree `d683a1cee6e29cddb2735734878f70c1ea382a05`.\n- 317 focused integration tests passed; none failed, skipped, or cancelled. Syntax checks covered 3,942 modules and import linking covered 3,938 modules, with no errors or manifest assignment gaps. Production build passed.\n- The final eight-target campaign completed 256 cases: 71 accepted, 179 rejected, 6 unsupported, zero findings or cancellations. Overall status remains **unsupported**, qualified false, exit 2.\n- The corrected PE loader completed two 512-case batches, totaling **714,755 ms** (11 minutes 54.755 seconds): 4 accepted, 1,020 rejected, zero unsupported cases, findings, or cancellations. The earlier failed 351,421 ms campaign receives no credit.\n- Evidence integrity passed: 175 capture digests (including all 169 originals unchanged), 119 JSON files, 30 campaign report digests, 36 JSON references, all 244 board identities, and all local document links checked.\n- Central `full-ci` qualification is pending. After ordinary core completes, one run will qualify this frozen PR head; its actual results will be retained separately.\n\n## Boundaries\n\nThe board capture verifies public membership and status, not hidden Agent/lease fields. Active and retained reservations are respected. Draft #4547 remains blocked by the separately reserved flaky-test consumer fixture. R015's browser component remains unexecuted in this environment; the separately named manual workflow is a reviewed proposal only because no valid directly scoped task reservation was established. The finite campaigns do not discharge the broader native/browser/performance/security/oracle/Rust/platform or upstream release obligations.\n\n## History and source identity\n\nThe existing evidence history and its merge of the completed implementation baseline are preserved. Local final commit `e961141594262bca70eba2121d40745e4555bdfe` publishes as `24fe2d86e3871997ac2266a9b3b0d21b0d44030c`; both point to verified tree `9486b49fda3da6302932182e75a530c9263dd6fa`. The commit SHAs differ because publication used GitHub Git objects. No rebase, squash, or force push was used.\n\nChanges outside the evidence directory are limited to the IL documentation prose described above. No issue closure keywords are included because the full remaining acceptance criteria are not complete.\n\n## Ordinary-core correction\n\nThe first non-cancelled ordinary core run [37209773138](https://github.com/wieslawsoltes/SharpForge/actions/runs/37209773138) failed because an archived disposable parent-probe source file retained its `.mjs` suffix and was scanned as repository executable code. The correction gives only that archive a `.mjs.txt` name, retains its original filename in metadata, and preserves all 1,341 source bytes and its original SHA-256. No policy exemption or source-content change was introduced. Six complete failure captures, including the actual merge checkout and full job log, are retained.\n\nThe corrected local head `c7cc7a514e7398ab152c4283f554b176f3869abc` publishes as `c9bda180705db8d4efebdec0023df3d31667a2a7`, with identical verified tree `f87ffca6ef47c89691bad1c4db0fdf3e12400f15`. Static checks and the production build passed on this clean committed revision; no product tests were rerun for this archival-only correction. Hosted ordinary core and central full qualification remain pending at this update.\n\nTask: SF-A00-T12.5","created_at":"2026-10-04T14:34:17Z","updated_at":"2026-10-04T14:48:06Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"33c30d7361feaca46642c833e6f9394996b09e1e","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[{"id":12524063633,"node_id":"LA_kwDOU59Ms88AAAAC6n4LkQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wieslawsoltes/SharpForge/labels/size/XXL","name":"size/XXL","color":"E50009","default":false,"description":null,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wieslawsoltes/SharpForge/pulls/4564/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wieslawsoltes/SharpForge/pulls/4564/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wieslawsoltes/SharpForge/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wieslawsoltes/SharpForge/issues/4564/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wieslawsoltes/SharpForge/statuses/c9bda180705db8d4efebdec0023df3d31667a2a7","head":{"label":"wieslawsoltes:codex/p4-remaining-record","ref":"codex/p4-remaining-record","sha":"c9bda180705db8d4efebdec0023df3d31667a2a7","user":{"login":"wieslawsoltes","id":2297442,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyOTc0NDI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2297442?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wieslawsoltes","html_url":"https://github.com/wieslawsoltes","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wieslawsoltes/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wieslawsoltes/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wieslawsoltes/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wieslawsoltes/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wieslawsoltes/su